0..75 Comment "// Calls of no arguments: a module member called through its module\'s name,"
76..151 Comment "// and a suspension called by its own. Such a call is its head\'s force, and"
152..227 Comment "// it answers at the call, as a call that applies arguments does: forcing a"
228..302 Comment "// thunk, after Levy\'s call-by-push-value (_Call-By-Push-Value_, Springer,"
303..343 Comment "// 2003, doi:10.1007/978-94-007-0954-6)."
